From: =?UTF-8?q?Kenan=20Kasumovi=C4=87?=
 <46025606+Ken5998@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:34:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): fsr 1 and cas sharpening without the fidelityfx sdk

The spatial FSR 1 (EASU + RCAS) and CAS paths of the presenter only need
the prebuilt shaders and the constants already in presenter.h, not the
FidelityFX SDK headers, so build them always. present_effect now accepts
cas and fsr on every build; fsr2 and fsr3 still need the runtime and fall
back to spatial FSR without it. The guard also changed the layout of
presenter.h between rexui and the code including it.
---
 include/rex/ui/d3d12/d3d12_presenter.h |  4 ----
 include/rex/ui/presenter.h             | 21 ---------------------
 include/rex/ui/vulkan/presenter.h      |  4 ----
 src/ui/CMakeLists.txt                  |  1 -
 src/ui/d3d12/d3d12_presenter.cpp       | 14 --------------
 src/ui/presenter.cpp                   | 24 ------------------------
 src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_presenter.cpp     | 10 ----------
 7 files changed, 78 deletions(-)

